  "description": "The Eastman Fixed Base Bench Vice is a durable, heavy-duty tool designed for securing workpieces in place during various tasks like clamping, cutting, grinding, and drilling. Built with S.G. (Spheroidal Graphite) casting, this vice combines the strength and durability of cast iron with enhanced toughness and shock resistance. S.G. casting, often referred to as ductile iron, offers superior strength and flexibility compared to traditional cast iron, making it ideal for heavy-duty applications where high stress or impact resistance is needed. The Eastman Fixed Base Bench Vice with S.G. casting is an essential tool for professionals and DIY enthusiasts who need a reliable, heavy-duty solution for securing their workpieces. The jaws of the vice can be adjusted to accommodate various sizes of workpieces, making it versatile and suitable for a range of tasks. Suitable for tasks that require precise clamping and secure holding of materials during machining, assembly, or fabrication processes. Ideal for use in metalworking, woodworking, automotive repair, and other industrial tasks.",
